# ESDF distance query (generic interface for NVBlox / Voxblox / OctoMap backends).
# Query point in map frame.
float64 x
float64 y
float64 z
---
# Signed distance to nearest obstacle (positive = free, negative = inside obstacle).
# For collision checking: valid and (distance > drone_radius + safety_margin).
float64 distance
bool valid   # false if point is outside map bounds or map not ready
